## Why the unique index is gone

A read-only pre-flight probe against PRODUCTION, run by the team lead (this session does not
touch the production database at all), found the Demo company alone holding five or more groups
of 55-79 approved or paid supplier invoices sharing one duplicate_fingerprint. CREATE UNIQUE
INDEX would have failed, and deploy.sh applies migrations before the rsync, so the deploy would
have aborted. The column cannot carry a constraint.

